Dear Nodal Officers,

Please refer to the updated guidelines issued regarding electronic record preservation and evidence handling under Section 63 of the Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam (BSA), 2023.

All public authorities and designated forensic examiners are advised to maintain verified SHA-256 cryptographic hashes and strict chain-of-custody logging for all ingested digital assets.

Detailed guidelines are available on the official portal at https://cybercrime.gov.in.

Yours sincerely,
